"icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>Where are your offices located?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>We have one office in San Francisco and one in Amsterdam.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>What countries do you hire in?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>The majority of our roles are US-based. We are able to hire full-time employees in the US, Canada (only Ontario and British Columbia), and the Netherlands. Other roles are engaged in international locations through our hiring partner, Pebl, which serves as the Employer of Record. Each job posting will state the location requirement, so be sure to review all the details in the description.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>Does Discord sponsor employees?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>Discord’s immigration policy includes:</p><ul role="list"><li>Continued sponsorship for any candidate with a current O-1, TN, E-3, H-1B1, or H-1B visa, provided they are eligible</li><li>Sponsorship of new TN or E-3 visas for Mexican/Canadian or Australian candidates</li><li>Sponsorship of Green Card for employees after 6 months of employment</li><li>Continued sponsorship of the Green Card process after 3 months of employment for candidates who have already received their priority date</li></ul><p>If you have any questions about these policies, be sure to connect with your recruiter should you be selected to interview!</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div class="all-faq"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>I submitted an application, when will I hear back from a recruiter?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>Thanks a ton for applying! We do our best to respond to each person who applies within two weeks. Given the incredibly high number of applicants to some roles, we cannot guarantee each candidate will get a response directly from a recruiter.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>I’m interested in a role at Discord, can I speak to a recruiter or hiring manager about it?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>We’re hyped you’re interested! Based on the volume of applications Discord receives, recruiters and hiring managers are unable to meet with everyone who’s interested. The best thing to do is apply for the role and the team will be sure to review your application.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>Can I apply to multiple positions at a time?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>You can! Although, we recommend that you apply only to the roles you are most interested in and qualified for. Please note that you may hear back at different times for each role you apply to, and you can expect a separate update for each role.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>I saw a job posting I was interested in, but I no longer see it on the careers page. What does this mean?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>This could mean a variety of things - ranging from high applicant volume that needs to be reviewed, to the role already being filled. Keep an eye on the jobs page for any similar roles, or the role being posted again!</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>What do I need to know before my interview?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>If you’re selected to interview, your recruiter will share all the details you need to know about the entire interview process - including how to prepare for each stage. Don’t hesitate to ask questions!</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>Do I have to write a Cover Letter?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>Double check the job description to see if one is required! It’s never a bad idea to write a cover letter, since it gives us a chance to get to know you better.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>What if I get an error when trying to apply?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>Applicants sometimes run into one of these errors:</p><ul role="list"><li>500 Internal Server Error</li><li>“Well this is awkward. There was a problem submitting your application. Please try again or hit up our team at jobs@discordapp.com”</li></ul><p>If you see one of these, we recommend these solutions:</p><ul role="list"><li>Try accessing the application by using an alternate browser such as Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, or Opera.</li><li>Use an incognito browser tab to see if that resolves the issue.</li></ul><p>If you run into an error regarding uploading an html or word doc, try uploading a PDF instead!</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="ad_faq top-none-line w-dropdown"><div class="ad_dropdown-toggle top-line-none is_2025 is-sdk-new w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="icons-absol is-update-new"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5881848816903d2494c1_Vector.svg" alt="" class="minus_faq"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/676d5821b15423be500e0b48_Vector.svg" alt="" class="plus"/></div><div>If I’ve been referred, do I also need to formally apply?</div></div><nav class="ad_dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="faq_rich is-sdk-2026 is_job w-richtext"><p>Nope! You do not need to apply if someone has already referred you. When someone refers you, your referrer submits your resume and any other application materials on your behalf. From there, we’ll be in touch if you are a good fit for the role.</p></div><div class="padding-16px"></div></nav></div></div><div class="btn-download-wr is-left_new"><a tabindex="0" data-w-id="242f8f04-7f2e-6ee2-40bf-6a711321da80" href="#" class="btn-download is_media is_2025">See All</a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="13313aff-cf22-e311-f9c0-2298e1f27501" class="download-banner bottom-small is-update"><div class="padding-global is_2026"><div class="container-944px"><div class="max-width-540 is-layout m-all"><h2 class="new-h1 text-color-white bottom-32-all is_mobile-24 is_2026 is-large bottom-small">Hungry for more?</h2><p class="body-text-new--xll">Check out our company principles to learn even more about what makes Discord a special place to work!</p><div class="padding-40px is-40 m-32"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/66f2d6111f59bc8ef97636cf_Pickaxe.png" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/66f2d6111f5